  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-070 (Phase 3 — engine / Gates): Parity gates: differential roll-up, persistence parity checklist, write chapter of HFR-PROTOCOL.\n\n### Scope\n\nParity gates: differential roll-up, persistence parity checklist, write chapter of HFR-PROTOCOL\n\n- Module: docs/tests · Difficulty: medium · Priority: medium\n- Audit source: C18, E-9, D13\n\n### Depends on\n\n- LOT-055 (#81)\n- LOT-057 (#83)\n\n(LOTS.md since #843; operator decision of 2026-11-12: LOT-168 and LOT-184 do not gate.)\n\n### Blocked by\n\n- #83\n- #81\n\n### Model\n\nOpus → Fable\n\n### Spec\n\nNo spec file on `dev-swift` yet (`docs/lots/LOT-070-*.md`).\n\n### PRs\n\nNone recorded.\n\n### Old issue (frozen)\n\n[francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#90](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/issues/90) — read-only history.\n\n### Owner / session\n\n—\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `blocked`.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
